<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it that work
never seems to cease?</font>

51
00:02:03,710 --> 00:02:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because you never bring
a single thing to completion, Tsunade-sama!</font>

52
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's disquiet among
the Kamizuru Clan?</font>

53
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a communique from
the ANBU Unit</font>

54
00:02:13,310 --> 00:02:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stationed in the Land of the Earth
isn't it?</font>

55
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a name one rarely hears.</font>

56
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kamizuru Clan are the insect handlers
of the Hidden Stone Village.</font>

57
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:24,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long ago they were so famous
as to be extolled</font>

58
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as equals of the Aburame Clan...</font>

59
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But they've died out and hardly anyone
remembers their name...</font>

60
00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

61
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It says there's been some disquiet
but there can't be many of them left.</font>

62
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really nothing to worry about...</font>

63
