00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:54,650
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Don't They?</font>

66
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:59,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... There are so many insects...</font>

67
00:02:59,810 --> 00:03:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is truly a paradise for insects...</font>

68
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't get stung will we?</font>

69
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost none of these insects will
cause bodily harm to humans.</font>

70
00:03:08,650 --> 00:03:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do have some of the Aburame Clan's
secret recipe insect repellent...</font>

71
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I would prefer not to use it
if at all possible.</font>

72
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it would also repel
the Bikochu.</font>

73
00:03:18,210 --> 00:03:20,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you shouldn't have
brought it out in the first place.</font>

74
00:03:24,210 --> 00:03:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake...</font>

75
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid in the lead...</font>

76
00:03:27,550 --> 00:03:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's a member of the Abarame Clan
after all.</font>

77
00:03:36,430 --> 00:03:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never imagined that
we'd bump into them in a place like this.</font>

78
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is their objective the Bikochu, Jibachi?</font>

79
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone who wants to get their hands
on a Bikochu</font>

80
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has to come to this place
during this particular period.</font>

81
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The restoration of the Kamizuru Clan
rests on the outcome of this mission...</font>

82
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to get our hands on
a Bikochu no matter what!</font>

83
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a female bikochu.</font>

84
00:04:06,990 --> 00:04:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pound its characteristics into your heads.</font>

85
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:10,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

86
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

87
