<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I've seen this thing before...</font>

88
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, really?!</font>

89
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did you see it, Naruto?</font>

90
00:04:19,890 --> 00:04:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was...</font>

91
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I inadvertently leave some food out
they start coming out of nowhere.</font>

92
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A whole deluge of them...</font>

93
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So those were Bikochu...</font>

94
00:04:35,660 --> 00:04:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's those things
they should be easy to catch.</font>

95
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

96
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

97
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:44,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are called... cockroaches.</font>

98
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Cockroaches?</font>

99
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're comparing apples to oranges.</font>

100
00:04:49,690 --> 00:04:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This thing is completely different!</font>

101
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They look exactly identical to me...</font>

102
00:04:55,990 --> 00:04:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— They're not!
— They're not!</font>

103
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on how one looks of it
this could be an opportunity.</font>

104
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean, Suzumebachi?</font>

105
00:05:07,710 --> 00:05:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been ten days since we came here...</font>

106
00:05:10,670 --> 00:05:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we haven't been able to get
any leads on the Bikochu.</font>

107
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However that kid from
the Abarame Clan might...</font>

108
00:05:17,050 --> 00:05:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That makes sense!</font>

109
00:05:18,390 --> 00:05:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean they might be able
to catch a Bikochu...</font>

110
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:25,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From their appearance
it seems they're all Genin.</font>

111
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they're able to catch
a Bikochu...</font>

112
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll just take it from them.</font>

113
00:05:35,410 --> 00:05:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All insects look alike.</font>

114
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insect Summoning Jutsu!</font>

115
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There aren't any... here...</font>

116
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This thing here
is different too, huh...</font>

117
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

118
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be a burden to everyone...</font>

119
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mission
is something that I suggested...</font>

120
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I will find it without fail!</font>

121
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

122
00:07:02,330 --> 00:07:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought...</font>

123
00:07:03,250 --> 00:07:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's difficult to perceive things
as small as insects.</font>

124
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

125
00:07:20,350 --> 00:07:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino! Kiba!</font>

126
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:24,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... Did you notice too?</font>

127
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... you did too?</font>

128
00:07:27,570 --> 00:07:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess... they think they're hiding...</font>

129
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately for them</font>

130
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we have a whole array of specialists
in detecting enemies.</font>

131
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:39,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do, Shino?
You're the leader of this mission.</font>

132
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we end up in a battle
there's the danger of involving the insects...</font>

133
00:07:44,210 --> 00:07:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and injuring the Bikochu.</font>

134
00:07:47,990 --> 00:07:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as they don't make a move
we'll just watch them closely.</font>

135
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it.</font>

136
00:07:51,950 --> 00:07:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if... Naruto noticed.</font>

137
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:57,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he had noticed
he would have raised a big clamor.</font>

138
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to stir things up.
So don't tell him.</font>

139
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

140
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shino! Shino!</font>

141
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:06,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found it! I found it!</font>

142
00:08:07,590 --> 00:08:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you
I found a Bikochu!</font>

143
00:08:16,450 --> 00:08:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He found it already?!</font>

144
00:08:17,730 --> 00:08:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible!</font>

145
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we spent ten days searching
and couldn't find one...!</font>

146
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome, Naruto...</font>

147
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you sure, Naruto?</font>

148
00:08:27,230 --> 00:08:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see it.</font>

149
00:08:30,030 --> 00:08:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See... this is it, right?</font>

150
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's exactly like the photo, right?</font>

151
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might be an insect-hunting genius.</font>

152
00:08:42,700 --> 00:08:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

153
00:08:43,370 --> 00:08:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does it look the same to you?</font>

154
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:46,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

155
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's called a Goliath beetle...</font>

156
00:08:52,300 --> 00:08:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! It's not the same thing?!</font>

157
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bikochu aren't active at night.</font>

158
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means that...</font>

159
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's call it a day then.</font>

160
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino... Shino!</font>

161
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found one!
This time there's no mistake!</font>

162
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably a completely
different insect again.</font>

163
00:09:17,770 --> 00:09:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

164
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! There's no mistake!</font>

165
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here! Over here!</font>

166
00:09:31,750 --> 00:09:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't hurry
it'll fly off somewhere!</font>

167
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, didn't you bring it with you?</font>

168
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found one that's resting in a tree.</font>

169
00:09:46,770 --> 00:09:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shape of its feelers is certainly
the same as Bikochu.</font>

170
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And all the characteristics match.</font>

171
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They do don't they?
There's no mistake it's this thing, right?!</font>

172
00:09:54,230 --> 00:09:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But... Naruto...</font>

173
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This thing is different after all, isn't it?</font>

174
00:09:59,110 --> 00:10:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is that?</font>

175
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not only size! How would you make
this one sniff scents?!</font>

176
00:10:06,330 --> 00:10:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like this!</font>

177
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This thing is called
a Fake Bikochu.</font>

178
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has an extremely
violent temperament...</font>

179
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It gets angry if one touches its nose
and sometimes even eats humans...</font>

180
00:10:17,050 --> 00:10:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

181
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

182
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shino! Didn't you say
there weren't any dangerous insects!</font>

183
00:10:39,950 --> 00:10:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost none... but not zero.</font>

184
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kurobachi... Jibachi...</font>

185
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really think they'll be able
to catch a Bikochu?</font>

186
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That might be difficult...
— That might be difficult...</font>

187
00:11:26,810 --> 00:11:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unless I control my Chakra
more perfectly</font>

188
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be able to find something
as small as an insect!</font>

189
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To come all this way and
continue training...</font>

190
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's quite admirable...</font>

191
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The air pressure has changed.</font>

192
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a sure sign that
the weather will change.</font>

193
00:12:28,190 --> 00:12:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I realize that.</font>

194
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wind charged with moisture
has started blowing...</font>

195
00:12:32,430 --> 00:12:34,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This means
there's gonna be rainfall.</font>

196
00:12:36,950 --> 00:12:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When it's such good weather?</font>

197
00:12:38,650 --> 00:12:40,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I can see clouds off in the distance...</font>

198
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

199
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:46,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to hurry.</font>

200
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it's said that the Bikochu
only lays an egg when it rains</font>

201
00:12:52,190 --> 00:12:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and larva emerges from the egg
the following morning.</font>

202
00:12:57,500 --> 00:12:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words</font>

203
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if it rains today it'll become
a mature larva tomorrow morning.</font>

204
00:13:02,030 --> 00:13:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In view of the season
this may well be our last chance.</font>

205
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this chance slips by</font>

206
00:13:06,950 --> 00:13:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will become impossible to search
for Sasuke using a Bikochu...</font>

207
00:13:10,530 --> 00:13:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

208
00:13:23,710 --> 00:13:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be fine.
I'll find it without fail!</font>

209
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't rain... Don't rain yet!</font>

210
00:13:51,410 --> 00:13:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Where is it?!</font>

211
00:13:53,780 --> 00:13:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come on out
before it rains!</font>

212
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

213
00:14:00,810 --> 00:14:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we gonna do...</font>

214
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:05,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if those guys don't find
a Bikochu Suzumebachi?</font>

215
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the Aburame Clan,</font>

216
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who was the catalyst in
the downfall of the Kamizuru Clan...</font>

217
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to avenge our clan's
longstanding grudge...</font>

218
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we will finish them off!</font>

219
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys...
They haven't made a move yet.</font>

220
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They must know that we're searching
for the Bikochu.</font>

221
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means that they must be waiting
for us to find one.</font>

222
00:14:35,310 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... So their plan is to steal it
from us once we've found one...</font>

223
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What cheapskates...</font>

224
00:14:51,450 --> 00:14:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rain...</font>

225
00:14:58,580 --> 00:15:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not this one either!</font>

226
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:03,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! When I told it not to rain!</font>

227
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no more time...</font>

228
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be a burden to everyone...</font>

229
00:15:16,970 --> 00:15:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So ultimately...
I contributed nothing.</font>

230
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's still plenty of time!</font>

231
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

232
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:37,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not go back on my word...
That's my Way of Ninja!</font>

233
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

234
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:46,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mission is something
I suggested!</font>

235
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Naruto hasn't given up
what's up with me giving up?!</font>

236
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

237
00:15:54,510 --> 00:15:58,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This rain may be
very advantageous to you.</font>

238
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

239
00:16:00,350 --> 00:16:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the surrounding temperature cools</font>

240
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:06,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">living creatures become
easier to discern.</font>

241
00:16:12,070 --> 00:16:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I won't give up either!</font>

242
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

243
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:26,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to...
I have to concentrate more...</font>

244
00:16:30,050 --> 00:16:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to... I need to...
control my Chakra!</font>

245
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see them!
So those are insects!</font>

246
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That insect... is wrong...</font>

247
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This insect is wrong too.</font>

248
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

249
00:16:53,450 --> 00:16:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There it is!</font>

250
00:16:56,110 --> 00:17:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! On the side of that tree!
There's a Bikochu there!</font>

251
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I caught it!</font>

252
00:17:25,980 --> 00:17:26,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it...!</font>

253
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it! I caught it!</font>

254
00:17:34,490 --> 00:17:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.
It's a female Bikochu.</font>

255
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes! I did it!
— Cripes...</font>

256
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your tenacity amazes me Naruto!</font>

257
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's so great, Naruto!</font>

258
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! It's thanks to you!</font>

259
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... is... hugging me...!</font>

260
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Akamaru?</font>

261
00:17:56,470 --> 00:17:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! It's an egg!</font>

262
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It laid an egg, huh...</font>

263
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

264
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will emerge by tomorrow...</font>

265
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So then we should make it
recognize Sasuke's scent, right?!</font>

266
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... I'll find you without fail!</font>

267
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:25,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like they finally found one...</font>

268
00:18:25,250 --> 00:18:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time has come, hasn't it?</font>

269
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

270
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto... He suddenly...</font>

271
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:40,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">pressed his face so close to mine...</font>

272
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... you were able
to dodge that one just now.</font>

273
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:53,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was pretty well done
for a Genin.</font>

274
00:18:54,570 --> 00:18:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're the ones who've
been trailing us all this time...</font>

275
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However I wonder if you'll be able
to escape from this attack?</font>

276
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Honey Jutsu!</font>

277
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bees?!</font>

278
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... that's...!</font>

279
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like you've noticed, huh.
That's honey.</font>

280
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honey that adheres like a bonding agent!</font>

281
00:19:35,190 --> 00:19:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I used up all my Chakra earlier...</font>

282
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That thing is a real bee.</font>

283
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

284
00:20:00,970 --> 00:20:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think, Akamaru?</font>

285
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

286
00:20:05,050 --> 00:20:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was convinced that those guys
would make some kind of move.</font>

287
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There hasn't been any sign
of them since earlier on...</font>

288
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a possibility that
we've overlooked something.</font>

289
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

290
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

291
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Hinata?</font>

292
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:20,400
